{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Pi","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.sequential_eq_s2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.sequential_eq_s2","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L64-L65","doc":"The sequential word's permutation is the single transposition `s₂` (the two squares cancel). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.crossTerm_q_one_eq_fixedPoint_diff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.crossTerm_q_one_eq_fixedPoint_diff","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L58-L62","doc":"**The order-zero cross term is a fixed-point-count difference**: `2 − 8 = −6`, the value of\nthe unnormalised cross term `[2]_q⁴·Δ` at `q = 1` measured in the T1 probe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings_sequential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings_sequential","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L55-L56","doc":"The sequential word's permutation fixes exactly `8 = 2^3` colourings: it is a transposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings_interleaved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings_interleaved","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The interleaved word's permutation fixes exactly `2 = 2^1` colourings: it is a 4-cycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.fixedColourings","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L46-L50","doc":"The number of `w`-invariant two-colourings of the four strands: the fixed-point count of\n`w` on `Fin 4 → Fin 2`, i.e. the character of the permutation representation on `V^{⊗4}`,\n`dim V = 2`, at `w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.sequential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.sequential","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L43-L44","doc":"The permutation of the sequential word `s₀² s₁² s₂` (the transposition `s₂`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.interleaved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.interleaved","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L40-L41","doc":"The permutation of the interleaved word `s₀ s₁ s₀ s₂ s₁` (a 4-cycle). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermFixedPointCount.s","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermFixedPointCount.lean#L37-L38","doc":"The adjacent transposition `s_i = (i, i+1)` on four strands. ","signatureChunk":0}]}